# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  e2e/.gitignore — adapted from the automation-test-project-template.
#
#  Pattern rules used below:
#   • `dir/`          ignores the folder AND everything in it (nothing inside can be re-included)
#   • `dir/*`         ignores the CONTENTS only, so `!dir/keep-me` can re-include single files
#   • `!pattern`      re-includes something an earlier rule ignored (last matching rule wins)
#   • Check any path: git check-ignore -v <path>
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── 1. Dependencies ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ── 2. Secrets & per-developer environment files ─────────────────────────────
#    Real values are generated locally by `npm run env:init` (random passwords).
#    Only the *.example templates are committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

# ── 3. Auth sessions (Playwright storageState) — contain live session cookies ─
.auth/*
!.auth/.gitkeep
!.auth/README.md

# ── 4. Test output — regenerated on every run ────────────────────────────────
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
playwright/.cache/
perf/results/

# ── 5. Local stack runtime files (TLS keys for the feed fixture, served feeds) ─
.stack/

# ── 6. AI tooling — personal/local only (shared AGENTS.md & CLAUDE.md ARE committed)
CLAUDE.local.md

# ── 7. OS & editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
